# argument                         |   type         |  require?   |   default
# .....................................................................................................
input                              |   string       |  mandatory  |   -
output                             |   string       |  mandatory  |  valor_fd_minidst.root
beam                               |   string       |  mandatory  | -
beam-pdg                           |   integer      |  mandatory  | -
disable-checks                     |   boolean      |  optional   |  false
mesg-thresholds                    |   string       |  optional   |  verbosity.xml
disable-extra-cuts                 |   boolean      |  optional   |  false
split-sample-by-res                |   boolean      |  optional   |  false
optimised-beam,reference-beam      |   boolean_list |  optional   |  optimised-beam
